cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "JM-LLM: reproduction package"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction code and results for a Jordan-matrix and encoder collaboration
  model for cyber threat prediction on UNSW-NB15, including the five-seed
  comparison, the mode-guided attention ablation, the directed-spectrum
  analysis, the false-positive cost analysis, the evasion analysis and the
  graph and capacity controls.
